  <item>
    <title>ep.075 UTMB：无论白天还是夜晚，都有人为你欢呼</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ea4fed3a5ff0a0ca230a7c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ea4fed3a5ff0a0ca230a7c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Sep 2024 03:58:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGENcNOBrkf6nvulBMWw4Tzs-NE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>在越野跑盛大的赛事 UTMB 中，热爱的能量有了最具像化的表达。不管你有没有跑完，成绩如何，每个人都在挑战自己，无论白天还是黑夜，都有人为你欢呼。我们在现场被这种巨大的能量感染。本期邀请越野跑选手、资深户外媒体人Marc以及越野跑爱好者Nate加入，一起分享 UTMB 现场那些让人难忘的瞬间。欢迎收听：）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh1w6OBjrskk8YJ1mD1rOgPNADsw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>收听指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">00:04:12</a> UTMB 现场体验：想哭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">00:11:43</a> 和我一起工作的人得了冠军</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1238">00:20:38</a> 为中国选手留下一张纪念的照片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">00:25:32</a> 两年前褪色的UTMB手环他还带着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">00:30:03</a> 那些启发我们的跑者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2561">00:42:41</a> 入坑越野跑：因为可以看更多的风景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2798">00:46:38</a> 如何熬过那些“我不行了”的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3310">00:55:10</a> 连续跑一天，跑者的乐趣来自哪里？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lghK9IrzZp-wirvERU64jvAQAMvm.m4a" length="116745149" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:20:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsP1ilMqhYkueuqWTRhfkD4xOPBz.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>ep.074 在山里感受过失温与中暑，更懂得敬畏之心</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66cd3bd1f78678cbe75957b8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66cd3bd1f78678cbe75957b8</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Aug 2024 02:37:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1976年，跑步者几乎被视为与社会格格不入的怪人时代，</span></p><span></span><p><span>在德国黑森州巴德阿罗尔森举行的慢速长跑开幕式上，</span></p><span></span><p><span>跑步传奇人物艾密尔·扎托比克说出举办活动的原因：</span></p><span></span><p><span>“鱼儿要游，鸟儿要飞，人类要跑”</span></p><span></span><p><span>跑是人的本能，倘若回到200多万年前，</span></p><span></span><p><span>真正让人跑起来的动力是生存，</span></p><span></span><p><span>与之相反，今天无数跑步者为了不同的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span>在森林，在公园，在街道跑步，</span></p><span></span><p><span>也发展出某些关于跑步的观念。</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客第 74 期户外运动博主@二郎真菌做客【尺不客听】，</span></p><span></span><p><span>从马拉松到越野跑，聊聊我们的跑步哲学。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你对越野跑感兴趣的话，</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们公众号文章最后附上来自二郎真菌的越野跑入门指南。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎查看。</span></p><span></span><p><span>收听指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">00:02:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>原来大家开始跑步的原因都是从好看的装备开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">00:08:12</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>坚持跑步的秘诀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">00:19:38</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>跑步带来的生活变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1334">00:22:14</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>跑步是一种向内的竞争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1661">00:27:41</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>第一次越野跑后想着再也不跑了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">00:31:58</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>越野跑遇到各种飞禽走兽是你的运气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2256">00:37:36</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>在山里体验过失温、中暑，更有敬畏之心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2739">00:45:39</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>跑人生第一场半马如何准备？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj-UE0LYUOf-P2vXIklgvPNxdwgG.m4a" length="84689184" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:58:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsP1ilMqhYkueuqWTRhfkD4xOPBz.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>ep.073 外面是夏天了，去探索崭新的人生吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6699f60c37236c546e3d6f19</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6699f60c37236c546e3d6f19</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Jul 2024 05:13:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>七月毕业季，人生在一个结束与开始的分界线之间。告别，然后迎接崭新的生活，生命旅程开始进入新一轮的探索。播客第73 期，我们邀请朋友巫毒一起闲聊毕业季，从墨尔本的城市记忆，户外探索的趣事，神奇的毕业旅行，到成长过程中的点滴感悟，一期关于冒险与成长的对话。欢迎收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期收听指南</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">00:02:06</a> 国内和澳洲高考的区别</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="687">00:11:27</a> 一个人在澳洲读书的经历</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1202">00:20:02</a> 毕业旅行与户外探险：神奇的trip</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1625">00:27:05</a> 城市记忆：墨尔本的独特魅力</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">00:35:18</a> 理想与现实：体验过的奇葩工作</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">00:56:00</a> 毕业感悟：成长是接受不喜欢的人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3628">01:00:28</a> 来者不惧：给过去的自己的话</span></strong></p>]]></description>
